Ren Wolfrider and his Primal Companion Fuzzynuts
Standing at just 3 feet 3 inches, Ren Wolfrider has the lean, wiry build of a young adult goblin. He sports a mane of brown hair shot through with natural copper highlights, framing a face dominated by sharp, intelligent yellow eyes. His leather armor is clearly hand-crafted and a bit amateurish, though serviceable enough to hold a bow across his back and a scimitar and shortsword at his hip.
ㅤㅤㅤㅤ
Riding alongside him—and often stealing the show—is a massive wolf with a strikingly thick, fluffy pelt of brown and silver. Far larger than a normal wolf, the beast possesses an undeniably supernatural aura and a keen, unusually intelligent gleam in its eyes that matches its rider's sharp gaze...
